Tonight, I'm talking to a fascinating man, ex-CIA, head of counterterrorism post 9-11 in Pakistan,

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:58.440
and ABC correspondent on terrorism issues, John Kiriakou.

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:10.440
So, you say there are a lot of scumbags, but there also, I guess, there are kind of dedicated, loyal patriotic people too, right, in the CIA?

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:19.440
Oh yeah, I still believe that the CIA is largely made up of thousands of patriotic, smart, good people.

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:26.440
People who want nothing more than to serve the American people and to ensure the safety and security of the country.

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:36.440
With that said, I've also been very public about my belief that the CIA's leadership is so sempathic and in many cases dangerous.

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:40.440
