00:42:30.800 --> 00:42:33.360
and in the evenings, you're doing your CIA job,

00:42:33.360 --> 00:42:34.920
which oftentimes takes you well

00:42:34.920 --> 00:42:36.280
into the middle of the night.

00:42:36.280 --> 00:42:38.000
And you just have to get used to working

00:42:38.000 --> 00:42:40.840
two, four-hour-a-week jobs at the same time.

00:42:40.840 --> 00:42:43.800
It's hard, but it's very rewarding.

