00:48:41.920 --> 00:48:47.920
Carlos was a very, very famous terrorist in the 1970s.

00:48:47.920 --> 00:48:52.920
Also a communist, he was actually a Leninist rather than a Stalinist.

00:48:52.920 --> 00:48:58.920
But he was quite violent and launched just spectacular attacks across Europe in the 1970s.

00:48:58.920 --> 00:49:04.920
So it was Carlos we were able to determine that was supplying another Greek terrorist group

00:49:04.920 --> 00:49:12.760
group called Popular Revolutionary Struggle, or ELA, with this weapon. And we were able to track

00:49:12.760 --> 00:49:18.520
the weapons from Carlos and his sources in the Middle East through Europe down to Greece. And

00:49:18.520 --> 00:49:24.600
that's how the Greeks got many other weapons. And then he was spotted. Carlos was hiding. And I had

00:49:24.600 --> 00:49:30.520
a friend from the CIA's counterterrorism center who just happened to be the vegetable

00:49:30.520 --> 00:49:38.620
market in cartoon and he saw who he thought was Carlos the Jackal so he

00:49:38.620 --> 00:49:44.920
went back to the senior CIA officer country and said I think I saw Carlos

00:49:44.920 --> 00:49:51.640
the Jackal in the vegetable market today and the chief said oh come on don't be

00:49:51.640 --> 00:49:56.200
ridiculous we're in the Sudan he just saw some random white guy and he said

00:49:56.200 --> 00:50:02.280
know I'm sure this is Carlos the Jackal. So they put a surveillance team down in the vegetable market

00:50:02.280 --> 00:50:07.320
and they waited a week or two and sure enough they saw the guy again and it was indeed Carlos

00:50:07.320 --> 00:50:15.320
the Jackal. So they set up a kind of a scam to catch him and without going into too many

00:50:16.200 --> 00:50:23.960
sensitive details they were able to get him to a dentist's office and the dentist put him

00:50:23.960 --> 00:50:44.960
under in order to fix his teeth. You know, they don't really use novocaine in many other parts of the world. They use gas, put it to sleep. And while he was asleep, we took him, we turned him over to the French government, and the French flew him from cartoon to Paris. He woke up in Paris, it shackled, and he's been serving a life sentence for multiple murders ever since.

00:50:44.960 --> 00:50:48.960
Oh my God. Never go to the dentist if you're involved in espionage.

00:50:48.960 --> 00:50:54.960
Did they know that he was in Khartoum? Did they have any idea that that was where he was hiding out?

00:50:54.960 --> 00:51:00.960
No, no idea at all. I mean, he thought maybe he's in Libya, maybe he's in Iraq, maybe he's in Venezuela.

00:51:00.960 --> 00:51:05.960
Nobody really knew. And then there he was, buying his own vegetables in the market in Khartoum.

00:51:05.960 --> 00:51:08.960
Unbelievable. That's a great story.

