Pakistan headquarters and then I had a domestic assignment and I resigned from that domestic

00:53:57.060 --> 00:54:03.700
assignment. Okay and that's when you left the CIA yes. Yeah I left the CIA in March of 2004.

00:54:03.700 --> 00:54:10.100
So you went really from an office job into a field job after you've done your training course.

00:54:10.100 --> 00:54:15.620
In the in the directorate of intelligence the analysts essentially sit in cubicles 365 days a

