profoundly boring to me. After a number of years, I just I couldn't see spending

00:54:30.420 --> 00:54:34.620
another 25 years doing that. So you volunteered yourself for the operational course?

00:54:34.620 --> 00:54:40.540
I volunteered and the move from intelligence to operations was very unusual but

00:54:40.540 --> 00:54:46.540
And it turned out I was the only person in the CIA who spoke both Greek and Arabic.

00:54:46.540 --> 00:54:50.540
And they were looking for somebody who spoke either Greek or Arabic,

